e.svg)Presentations](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=presentations#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Publications](/site/assets/files/3394/002-file.svg)Publications](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=publications#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Supporting Documents](/site/assets/files/2122/002-file.svg)Supporting Documents](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=supporting-documents#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Training Materials](/site/assets/files/2116/002-file.svg)Training Materials](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=training-materials#list_documentation_table)\n    -   [![Website Updates](/site/assets/files/6235/002-file.svg)Website Updates](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/?doc-type=website-updates#list_documentation_table)\n-   [Tools](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/tools/)\n\nGene\n\n-   Gene Symbol\n-   Gene Name\n-   Disease Name\n-   Drug Name\n-   Region (GRCh37)\n-   Region (GRCh38)\n\n-   [Variant](http://reg.clinicalgenome.org)\n-   [Website Content](https://clinicalgenome.org/search/)\n\n     Search\n\n-   [Curated Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes/curations)\n    -   [All Curated Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes/curations)\n    -   [ACMG SF v3.3 Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes/acmgsf)\n-   [Gene-Disease Validity](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-validity)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-validity)\n    -   [Curations by Expert Panel](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/affiliate)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_gene-disease-validity')\n-   [Dosage Sensitivity](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-dosage)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-dosage)\n    -   [Recurrent CNV](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/gene-dosage/cnv)\n    \n    -   [FTP File Downloads (CSV, BED, TSV)](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_dosage')\n-   [Clinical Actionability](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/actionability)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/actionability)\n    -   [Curations in Adult Context](https://actionability.clinicalgenome.org/ac/Adult/ui/summ)\n    -   [Curations in Pediatric Context](https://actionability.clinicalgenome.org/ac/Pediatric/ui/summ)\n    -   [Scoring Metric](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/docs/semi-quantitative-scoring-metric/)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads/#section_actionability)\n-   [Curated Variants](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/variant-pathogenicity/all)\n    -   [All Curations](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/variant-pathogenicity/all)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads#section_variant)\n-   [Statistics](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/reports/stats)\n-   [More](#)\n    -   [All Genes](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/genes)\n    -   [All Disease](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/conditions)\n    -   [All Drugs & Medications](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/drugs)\n    \n    -   [File Downloads & APIs](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/downloads)\n-   [](#)\n    -   [About ClinGen's Website](/tools/clingen-website-faq/)\n    -   [Learn About New Features](/docs/?doc-type=website-updates)\n    -   [How To Cite ClinGen](/tools/clingen-website-faq/how-to-cite/)\n    -   [External Data Attribution](/tools/clingen-website-faq/attribution/)\n    -   [Contact Us](/about/contact-clingen/)\n\n# Clinical Domain Working Groups\n\n[Back](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/kidney-disease-cdwg/)\n\n## Complement-Mediated Kidney Diseases Gene Curation Expert Panel\n\n[Affiliated to **Kidney Disease CDWG**](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/working-groups/clinical-domain/kidney-disease-cdwg/)\n\n[Membership](#heading_membership)\n\n---\n\nThe broad scope of the Complement-Mediated Kidney Diseases Gene Curation Expert Panel (GCEP) will be to curate genes associated with complement-mediated kidney diseases, with an initial focus on thrombotic microangiopathy (TMA), particularly atypical hemolytic uremic syndrome (aHUS), and C3 glomerulopathy (C3G). Genetic forms of TMA that do not implicate the complement system (such as those due to defects in coagulation pathway genes) will also be an area of focus. To date, defects in ~40 genes have been asserted to cause these diseases and this list will continue to expand. The Complement-Mediated Kidney Diseases GCEP will first curate complement-mediated disorders that result in a primarily renal phenotype. Genes with a primary phenotype outside the scope of our work will be left until the end of phase 1 curations, with the expectation that they will only be curated if no other GCEP plans to curate them. The Complement-Mediated Kidney Diseases GCEP will also work closely with the Immunology CDWG, with representatives included in the GCEP membership. Genes of interest that overlap with existing GCEPs (e.g. Hemostasis/Thrombosis GCEP or Glomerulopathy GCEPs) will be identified and resolved, and where significant overlap exists with the purview of other GCEPs, curations will be jointly reviewed. The gene list for curation was selected based on expert consensus, combined with review of literature and of multi-gene sequencing panels from the Genetic Testing Registry.\n\n[View all Gene-Disease Validity classifications approved by this GCEP.](https://search.clinicalgenome.org/kb/affiliate/40069)\n\n#### Expert Panel Status *\\- Approved Expert Panel*\n\nStep 1\n\nStep 2\n\nDefine Group  \n*Complete*\n\nExpert Panel Approval  \n*Completed Jul. 2022*\n\n### Expert Panel Membership\n\nMembership spans many fields, including genetics, medical, academia, and industry.\n\n#### Chairs\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11378/pwimg_iiri5m.600x600.png ) **Yasar Caliskan MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/caliskan-11378 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Anuja Java MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/java-11381 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11383/pwimg_61dbqd.600x600.png ) **David Kavanagh BSc, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/kavanagh-11383 )\n\n#### Coordinators\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11372/pwimg_y0sq7k.600x600.png ) **Pamela Ajuyah Robertson PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/ajuyah-robertson-11372 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11374/pwimg_nqvt7m.600x600.jpeg ) **Alicia Byrne, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/byrne-11374 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11373/pwimg_rwerjl.600x600.jpeg ) **Julie Ratliff BSc, MPH**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/ratliff-11373 )\n\n#### [Members (16)](#collapseMembersmembershipAccordion14142)\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12263/pwimg_4l9xjl.600x600.jpeg ) **Makena Caron MS, GCG, LGC**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/caron-12263 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Arlene Chapman MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/chapman-11972 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Dorottya Csuka MSc, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/csuka-12256 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Omar Farag None**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/farag-12262 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Veronique Fremeaux-Bacchi MD, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/fremeaux-bacchi-12258 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Daniel Gale MBBCh, PhD, FRCP**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/gale-11964 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11371/pwimg_czjfbm.600x600.jpeg ) **Vanessa Gitau BA**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/gitau-11371 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12111/pwimg_1mtxqd.600x600.jpeg ) **Mathieu Lemaire MSc, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/lemaire-12111 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Christoph Licht MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/licht-12261 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Alison Ma MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/ma-12260 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12259/pwimg_z5vdjt.600x600.jpeg ) **Ann Moyer MD, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/moyer-12259 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/11388/pwimg_g5u1nl.600x600.jpeg ) **Judy Savige MBBS, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/savige-11388 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Richard Smith, MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/smith-11577 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Ágnes Szilágyi PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/szilgyi-12257 )\n\n [![](/site/templates/resources/img/defaults/user_square.png ) **Farid Ullah MSc, PhD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/ullah-12264 )\n\n [![](/site/assets/files/12117/pwimg_2m7hms.600x600.jpeg ) **Janewit Wongboonsin MS, MD**]( https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/wongboonsin-12117 )\n\n---\n\n##### Chairs\n\n[Yasar Caliskan MD](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/caliskan-11378/)\n\n[Anuja Java MD](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/java-11381/)\n\n[David Kavanagh BSc, PhD](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/kavanagh-11383/)\n\n---\n\n##### Coordinators\n\nPlease contact a coordinator if you have questions.\n\n[Pamela Ajuyah Robertson PhD](https://www.clinicalgenome.org/about/people/staff/ajuyah-robertson-11372/)\n\n[proberts@broadinstitute.org](mailto:proberts@broadinstitute.org)\n\n[Alici