{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778377835742,"sessionID":"ses_1f06d460bffe27TyutQIv0mNWW","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_uvFb1R9gKGmL7NUDu2iOyNNU","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/terms/MONDO_7770736.obo","offset":1,"limit":80},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/terms/MONDO_7770736.obo</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: [Term]\n2: id: MONDO:7770736\n3: name: TSEN2-related neurodevelopmental disorder with or without thrombotic microangiopathy\n4: def: \"Any neurodevelopmental disorder in which the cause of the disease is a variation in the TSEN2 gene. This condition can be associated with pontocerebellar hypoplasia and other brain structural anomalies; developmental delay, intellectual disability, hypotonia, motor delay, ataxia, and vision issues; and may include cardiac, pulmonary, and renal features such as thrombotic microangiopathy, proteinuria, end-stage kidney disease, and hypertension.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40069/, PMID:18711368, PMID:20952379, PMID:23562994, PMID:32404165, PMID:38347586, PMID:38438125, PMID:38622473]\n5: is_a: MONDO:0700092 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40069/\", source=\"PMID:18711368\", source=\"PMID:20952379\", source=\"PMID:23562994\", source=\"PMID:32404165\", source=\"PMID:38347586\", source=\"PMID:38438125\", source=\"PMID:38622473\"} ! neurodevelopmental disorder\n6: intersection_of: MONDO:0700092 ! neurodevelopmental disorder\n7: intersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/28422 ! TSEN2\n8: relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/28422 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40069/\", source=\"PMID:18711368\", source=\"PMID:20952379\", source=\"PMID:23562994\", source=\"PMID:32404165\", source=\"PMID:38347586\", source=\"PMID:38438125\", source=\"PMID:38622473\"} ! TSEN2\n9: propert